  "citation": "Edmonds J A; Reilly J M; Barns D W (1995): The IEA/ORAU Long-Term Global Energy- CO2 Model: Personal Computer Version A84PC. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, Tennessee (USA); Institute for Energy Analysis, Oak Ridge Associated Universities, Washington, D.C. (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ESS.CMP002",
